# The Git check in the close workspace dialog: whether closing would leave
# work behind. Each sentence shows only when it applies.

workspace-close-checking = 正在检查未提交的文件和未推送的提交…
workspace-close-dirty = 存在未提交的文件。
workspace-close-unpushed = 存在未推送的提交。
workspace-close-unknown = 无法验证每个检出目录的 Git 状态。
workspace-close-clean = 未发现未提交的文件或未推送的提交（依据本地远程跟踪引用）。
# $word is what the user types to agree, "close" in every language; keep it
# as it is. "Cancel" names the dialog's Cancel button.
workspace-close-consent = 输入 { $word } 以同意仍然关闭，或取消以继续工作。
